---
---
<section id="brand-philosophy" class="py-24 bg-premium-dark border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <p class="text-gold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
        Brand Philosophy
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4">
        Luxury fitness that respects your ambition and your time.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        We design discipline that feels effortless—marrying science, service, and style so you can lead with confidence on and off the floor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.08)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"></path><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path><path d="M12 18v4"></path><path d="m4.9 19.1 2.9-2.9"></path><path d="m19.1 19.1-2.9-2.9"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold">Mindset over hype</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We build repeatable rituals that outlast motivation—small, consistent wins layered into your day.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.08)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3Z"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold">Discipline with elegance</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Every touchpoint is intentional: clean programming, calm coaching, and zero noise.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.08)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold">Lifestyle first</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Your work, family, and travel shape the plan. We adapt so progress stays sustainable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

